<title>USA: Gannett Inc Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>Gannett Inc Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.82		    $0.64</p>
<p> Oper net		 115,348		   90,278</p>
<p> Revs		   1,117,741		  864,863</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $2.47		    $2.22</p>
<p> Oper net		 348,189		  311,024</p>
<p> Revs		   3,309,614		2,673,440</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net from continuing operations exclude earnings from discontinued operations of $4.7 million, or $0.03/shr, vs $5.8 million, or $0.05/shr, in quarter and $11.2 million, or $0.08/shr, vs $10.7 million, or $0.08/shr, in nine months.</p>
<p>Both 1996 periods also include gain of $295.6 million, or $2.09/shr, on sale of outdoor business.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
